\fBdedalus completion\fR
Print a shell completion script. See dedalus\-completion(1).
.SH "SHELL COMPLETION"
dedalus completion <shell> prints a completion script for bash, zsh, and fish. Load it from your shell startup file:
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
eval "$(dedalus completion bash)"
eval "$(dedalus completion zsh)"
dedalus completion fish | source
.fi
.RE
